w echelon form matrix $M$ is given below. What are the pivot columns of $M?$\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -6 & 8 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the pivots of a matrix in row echelon form are the first non-zero entries in each row of the matrix.\n\nWe can see that $M$ has $3$ pivots in the $1$st, $3$rd, and $4$th columns:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -6 & 8 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130935/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "488c9762-554b-5ea6-b414-ce6cbde9bbd1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130935"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73607/selection/06bf89e9fe9bd2978d91ae6a9925dcc52276fdd44f8de901ef2103c38fcbff28" :answer/id #uuid "d1c4c9a2-91f6-57ec-a8a8-b66eb48001c0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$1$st and $3$rd only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73607/selection/d246bd62de2d43ff94e3122caf846707e281e7ed29d9036efb64ce3fb37aaea7" :answer/id #uuid "f21968b9-66ec-5ac4-b51b-2a37ee493fec" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$1$st, $2$nd, and $3$rd" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73607/selection/0617f40c30d3177ee66fae7128600d63e0a36dcd56b2d8d825516d16b1bfc4ec" :answer/id #uuid "be21f791-6a6f-528e-903f-e4a076ecb154" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3$rd only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73607/selection/c12325f74ab3486398192a8d5229dcc8858f296945874fe16d6865db6a7dc4f8" :answer/id #uuid "907d9d8b-ffca-5264-a308-8f4432daa13b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$1$st only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73607/selection/02b0be138d8a0f39c7c3b7759031408a6993e6def8ee036ed0124e8b802e1efa" :answer/id #uuid "7aad6e47-db4f-5d8b-941b-51ad9fabb448" :answer/type :answer.ty